<title>NIGERIA: British trade mission to visit Nigerian oil sector.</title>
<headline>British trade mission to visit Nigerian oil sector.</headline>
<dateline>LAGOS 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>A trade mission comprising 13 British oil and gas firms will visit the Nigerian oil sector next month, the British embassy in Lagos said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>It said in a statement that the trade mission would come to Lagos and travel to the oil-producing cities of Port Harcourt and Warri in the southeast where it would organise seminars on the oil industry.</p>
<p>--Lagos newsroom +234 1 2630317</p>
